  "changelog": "- Initial release of the precision forestry monitoring skill.\n- Integrates multi-source remote sensing to assess individual tree, stand, health, and biomass levels for forest inventory and management.\n- Supports estimation of tree height, crown width, DBH, and stand volume using CHM and allometric equations.\n- Provides health grading via NDVI/NDRE and biomass estimation via SAR data fusion.\n- Includes offline synthetic data generation; all processing is local for privacy.\n- Outputs include tree-level GeoJSON, stand-level statistics, health and biomass maps, and management recommendations.",
